1
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:07,250
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

2
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:11,860
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

3
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:16,120
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

4
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:20,330
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

5
00:00:20,670 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

6
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:24,730
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

7
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,880
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

8
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:28,760
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

9
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,650
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

10
00:00:30,930 --> 00:00:33,320
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

11
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:35,800
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

12
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:40,560
♪Come, share a cup with me♪

13
00:00:40,570 --> 00:00:42,540
(Welcome to Cold Palace Refreshments)

14
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,040
=Farm Busily in the Cold Palace=

15
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,620
(Based on Hongshu.com's novel
I'm Busy Farming in the Cold Palace)

16
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:49,650
=Episode 20=

17
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:51,560
Oh!

18
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:53,920
Look at that little face.

19
00:00:54,159 --> 00:00:56,039
He looks just like the late Emperor.

20
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:00,439
Why not let me raise him here?

21
00:01:00,759 --> 00:01:02,039
Yes, Mother.

22
00:01:08,079 --> 00:01:09,319
Your Majesty.

23
00:01:09,319 --> 00:01:10,840
I have urgent news.

24
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:13,159
What is it?

25
00:01:13,640 --> 00:01:15,159
I...

26
00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:17,439
I was just outside Shuxin Hall

27
00:01:17,439 --> 00:01:19,519
and heard that His Majesty

28
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:21,200
is recovering.

29
00:01:23,319 --> 00:01:24,599
What did you say?

30
00:01:26,120 --> 00:01:27,040
How is that possible?

31
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:28,480
He has the disease,

32
00:01:28,480 --> 00:01:29,599
not some common chill!

33
00:01:29,599 --> 00:01:30,840
How could he recover so fast?

34
00:01:31,599 --> 00:01:32,439
I...

35
00:01:32,439 --> 00:01:35,359
I personally heard Eunuch Cao order that
a meal be served.

36
00:01:35,439 --> 00:01:38,159
He said His Majesty's appetite is
returning.

37
00:01:41,799 --> 00:01:42,799
Mother.

38
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:47,599
All that crying

39
00:01:47,799 --> 00:01:49,159
is giving me a headache.

40
00:01:49,879 --> 00:01:51,000
Take him home.

41
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:59,079
Prepare my sedan for Shuxin Hall.

42
00:01:59,799 --> 00:02:01,359
I'll see for myself

43
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:03,799
whether it's a miracle

44
00:02:04,319 --> 00:02:06,239
or his final flicker of life.

45
00:02:09,199 --> 00:02:10,199
Your Majesty,

46
00:02:10,199 --> 00:02:11,879
you've recovered?

47
00:02:13,039 --> 00:02:15,080
It was only a slight chill.

48
00:02:15,759 --> 00:02:18,520
Yet it's kept you worried day and night,

49
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:21,560
visiting me so often, Mother.

50
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:25,599
You bear the cares of the realm,

51
00:02:25,719 --> 00:02:27,919
and I raised you myself.

52
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:29,800
Of course I'd...

53
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:30,599
Oh?

54
00:02:30,879 --> 00:02:32,680
Then why do I hear

55
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:35,000
you secretly summoned the Fourth
Prince's consort to the palace

56
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:38,240
and offered to raise her youngest son?

57
00:02:42,759 --> 00:02:44,400
I'm getting old.

58
00:02:44,520 --> 00:02:46,840
I enjoy having grandchildren around.

59
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:48,479
Besides,

60
00:02:48,479 --> 00:02:52,680
he looks so much like the late Emperor.

61
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:55,759
It brings me great comfort.

62
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:58,319
Mother,

63
00:03:00,479 --> 00:03:02,080
I'm still alive.

64
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:07,960
What do you mean by that?

65
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:15,479
Mother,

66
00:03:15,479 --> 00:03:16,599
I am

67
00:03:16,919 --> 00:03:18,280
still alive.

68
00:03:20,319 --> 00:03:22,719
What do you mean, Your Majesty?

69
00:03:24,639 --> 00:03:26,360
Do you really think

70
00:03:26,759 --> 00:03:28,879
being confined to Shuxin Hall

71
00:03:29,599 --> 00:03:31,800
has made me blind and deaf?

72
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:36,199
Rest well, Your Majesty.

73
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:39,560
I'll return to my palace.

74
00:03:39,639 --> 00:03:40,560
Wait.

75
00:03:45,759 --> 00:03:47,800
Do you recognize this?

76
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:55,680
(Send the mute servant at once.)

77
00:03:56,039 --> 00:03:59,800
(Deliver the letter to Xiqing's emperor
in person.)

78
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:02,240
I...

79
00:04:03,319 --> 00:04:04,560
don't recognize it.

80
00:04:15,199 --> 00:04:16,720
"The Emperor has the disease.

81
00:04:17,839 --> 00:04:19,519
Unrest threatens the court.

82
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:23,279
I intend to install a new emperor.

83
00:04:24,879 --> 00:04:26,879
Send elite troops at once."

84
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:28,600
Give it back!

85
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:29,360
Mother,

86
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:33,120
surely many at court

87
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:35,439
would recognize your handwriting?

88
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:38,720
I think

89
00:04:39,160 --> 00:04:40,720
you should have cut off

90
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:42,959
that mute servant's writing hand too.

91
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:47,839
Wujue, let me explain!

92
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:49,000
Mother,

93
00:04:50,519 --> 00:04:52,040
I never wanted us

94
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,680
to turn on each other.

95
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:00,639
If I die,

96
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:04,360
how will you face your birth mother,

97
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:07,439
my own sister, in the afterlife?

98
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:08,639
Which is why

99
00:05:09,439 --> 00:05:12,160
I'll give you a chance to make amends.

100
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:15,959
I hear

101
00:05:16,959 --> 00:05:18,959
that before you entered the palace,

102
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:21,759
you were very close to Bai Zhenhai.

103
00:05:24,439 --> 00:05:25,800
In three days,

104
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:28,439
I want his Tiger Military Tally in hand.

105
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:33,120
Your Majesty.

106
00:05:36,879 --> 00:05:39,120
Summon Bai Zhenhai at once.

107
00:05:42,759 --> 00:05:44,439
Of everyone who came with me today,

108
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:47,920
leave none alive.

109
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:49,040
Yes, Your Majesty.

110
00:05:58,553 --> 00:05:59,280
Come on, let's go.

111
00:05:59,360 --> 00:06:00,399
Where to?

112
00:06:05,279 --> 00:06:06,600
Ha-ha-ha!

113
00:06:07,319 --> 00:06:08,800
Lovely weather, isn't it?

114
00:06:09,319 --> 00:06:09,920
Yes.

115
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:11,360
A stroll after a good meal.

116
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:11,920
Yes.

117
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:12,319
Oh!

118
00:06:12,319 --> 00:06:13,079
Your Majesty!

119
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:14,279
What a coincidence!

120
00:06:14,279 --> 00:06:14,800
Oh!

121
00:06:16,439 --> 00:06:17,079
Where...

122
00:06:17,079 --> 00:06:18,560
Where's my jade pendant?

123
00:06:18,839 --> 00:06:19,759
I'll help you look.

124
00:06:19,759 --> 00:06:20,439
By the bed.

125
00:06:20,439 --> 00:06:21,360
Oh.

126
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:22,639
Enough.

127
00:06:23,319 --> 00:06:25,079
You've heard everything anyway.

128
00:06:25,279 --> 00:06:26,199
What?

129
00:06:26,199 --> 00:06:27,839
You think I'd kill you to silence you?

130
00:06:28,079 --> 00:06:29,439
Brother,

131
00:06:29,439 --> 00:06:32,519
she's... she's...

132
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:34,680
Is treason so hard to say?

133
00:06:36,199 --> 00:06:37,639
I wouldn't dare.

134
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:42,240
Did you take pity on her?

135
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:45,920
She does look

136
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:47,759
a lot like your late mother.

137
00:06:48,639 --> 00:06:50,680
The epidemic still rages in Shangyuan.

138
00:06:51,759 --> 00:06:53,519
If I punish her now,

139
00:06:54,079 --> 00:06:55,240
the Bai family will rebel,

140
00:06:55,639 --> 00:06:57,240
and Xiqing will seize its chance.

141
00:06:58,160 --> 00:07:00,399
So you want to appease her

142
00:07:00,639 --> 00:07:01,920
until you've secured the tally?

143
00:07:02,839 --> 00:07:03,639
Hmph.

144
00:07:04,519 --> 00:07:06,639
The Tiger Military Tally belongs to the
throne.

145
00:07:07,279 --> 00:07:08,680
I'm merely reclaiming it.

146
00:07:09,439 --> 00:07:12,040
If she behaves herself from now on,

147
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:14,560
I'll spare her life.

148
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:18,519
Your Majesty,

149
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:22,000
let me treat the epidemic in Shangyuan.

150
00:07:23,639 --> 00:07:25,000
Do you know how dangerous that is?

151
00:07:25,439 --> 00:07:26,240
I'm not afraid.

152
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:28,000
I have a treatment,

153
00:07:28,519 --> 00:07:31,040
but I need to test it on poultry.

154
00:07:31,519 --> 00:07:32,519
If it works,

155
00:07:33,199 --> 00:07:34,759
we can inoculate people with cowpox.

156
00:07:34,959 --> 00:07:37,120
The people of Donglan need never fear
smallpox again.

157
00:07:40,839 --> 00:07:41,920
What are the odds?

158
00:07:42,839 --> 00:07:43,800
Seventy...

159
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:47,279
Ninety percent.

160
00:07:47,279 --> 00:07:48,680
I'll leave ten percent,

161
00:07:48,879 --> 00:07:50,120
so Heaven can take some credit.

162
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:57,399
Your Majesty,

163
00:07:58,279 --> 00:07:59,800
just wait here at court for me.

164
00:08:02,879 --> 00:08:03,920
Come back alive.

165
00:08:05,399 --> 00:08:06,120
I will.

166
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:19,720
Do you remember this jade pendant?

167
00:08:20,399 --> 00:08:22,000
When we first met,

168
00:08:22,800 --> 00:08:24,240
I placed it in your hands.

169
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:28,279
And you promptly sold it.

170
00:08:29,279 --> 00:08:31,600
You said it was worth a fortune.

171
00:08:31,600 --> 00:08:32,799
I didn't believe you.

172
00:08:32,799 --> 00:08:34,000
I almost took a huge loss.

173
00:08:35,159 --> 00:08:37,240
If you lose it again,

174
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:40,440
I'll keep you in the palace for life.

175
00:08:43,039 --> 00:08:44,720
You mean...

176
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:49,799
The world is yours to roam.

177
00:08:54,399 --> 00:08:55,639
Once everything is settled,

178
00:08:56,799 --> 00:08:57,600
I will

179
00:08:58,320 --> 00:08:59,759
escort you out myself.

180
00:09:08,759 --> 00:09:10,240
Cousin,

181
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:12,399
must I get on my knees and beg?

182
00:09:17,559 --> 00:09:18,440
Jin...

183
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,159
Your Majesty.

184
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:25,000
I...

185
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:27,679
This Tiger Military Tally

186
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:31,080
determines who commands 100,000 border
troops.

187
00:09:31,519 --> 00:09:33,279
If His Majesty takes it,

188
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:35,159
the Bai family

189
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:38,840
will have no standing at court.

190
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:42,840
Cousin,

191
00:09:44,759 --> 00:09:46,080
do you remember

192
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:48,120
twenty years ago,

193
00:09:49,159 --> 00:09:50,639
when you saw me off to the palace,

194
00:09:51,759 --> 00:09:53,600
what you said to me?

195
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,639
I said

196
00:10:00,039 --> 00:10:02,039
to guard this realm

197
00:10:03,039 --> 00:10:05,039
for the Empress.

198
00:10:07,159 --> 00:10:08,440
But now,

199
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:14,360
I've been branded a traitor,

200
00:10:15,519 --> 00:10:18,000
and reviled for generations.

201
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,200
I'll give it to you.

202
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:34,759
Just please don't debase yourself.

203
00:10:38,159 --> 00:10:39,960
My foolish cousin.

204
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:48,759
Tomorrow at 11 a.m.,

205
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:50,919
bring me the Tiger Military Tally.

206
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:56,360
Your Majesty.

207
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:57,799
His Majesty has just recovered,

208
00:10:57,799 --> 00:11:00,399
and Shuxin Hall is no longer sealed.

209
00:11:03,159 --> 00:11:04,720
You may go, General Bai.

210
00:11:05,799 --> 00:11:08,600
Remember, tomorrow at 11 a.m.

211
00:11:11,759 --> 00:11:12,639
Yes, Your Majesty.

212
00:11:22,279 --> 00:11:23,960
Nine out of ten

213
00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:26,279
die of smallpox.

214
00:11:28,080 --> 00:11:31,320
His Majesty is hard to kill.

215
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:33,279
That Lady Lu in the Cold Palace...

216
00:11:33,279 --> 00:11:34,559
Since she won his favor,

217
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:37,320
his prayers brought rain,

218
00:11:37,519 --> 00:11:38,679
he gained miracle wheat,

219
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:42,720
and now she's saved him from death.

220
00:11:43,159 --> 00:11:44,600
It's too strange.

221
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:46,279
Could she be...

222
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:50,080
Summon the Director of the Imperial
Observatory.

223
00:11:50,879 --> 00:11:53,600
Let's see how powerful

224
00:11:54,559 --> 00:11:56,879
this witch really is.

225
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:23,470
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

226
00:12:23,860 --> 00:12:28,080
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

227
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:32,300
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

228
00:12:32,360 --> 00:12:36,550
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

229
00:12:36,890 --> 00:12:40,950
♪Cool dew, starry nights,
wheat sprouts in my hands♪

230
00:12:41,020 --> 00:12:45,200
♪I shape fields, not painted brows,
and fill them with hope♪

231
00:12:45,640 --> 00:12:49,010
♪Gold and silver bloom from the soil♪

232
00:12:49,480 --> 00:12:54,160
♪I smile as the world storms on♪

233
00:12:55,820 --> 00:12:57,970
♪No finery to rival spring♪

234
00:12:58,150 --> 00:13:02,450
♪All I wish for are waves of green♪

235
00:13:04,860 --> 00:13:06,610
♪Where is beauty found?♪

236
00:13:06,790 --> 00:13:11,220
♪Just lift your eyes and see♪

237
00:13:11,780 --> 00:13:13,350
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

238
00:13:13,370 --> 00:13:15,840
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

239
00:13:15,910 --> 00:13:17,990
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

240
00:13:18,150 --> 00:13:19,920
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

241
00:13:20,530 --> 00:13:21,800
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

242
00:13:22,030 --> 00:13:24,430
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

243
00:13:24,670 --> 00:13:26,970
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

244
00:13:27,250 --> 00:13:31,570
♪Come, share a cup with me♪
